{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","name_native":"سنن النسائي","section":{"37":"The Book of Fighting [The Prohibition of Bloodshed]"},"section_detail":{"37":{"hadithnumber_first":3966,"hadithnumber_last":4132,"arabicnumber_first":3966,"arabicnumber_last":4132,"name_native":"كتاب القتال [تحريم الدماء]"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3996,"arabicnumber":3996,"text":"اخبرنا محمد بن العلاء، قال حدثنا ابو معاوية، قال حدثنا الاعمش، عن شقيق، عن عبد الله، قال اول ما يقضى بين الناس في الدماء","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Muquf"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Muquf"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":37,"hadith":31}}]}